Subject: [PATCH] Optimize canSee checks
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Project: SparklyPaper (https://github.com/SparklyPower/SparklyPaper)
Author: MrPowerGamerBR <git@mrpowergamerbr.com>
License: GPL-3.0 (https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html)

Description:
* This patch is based on SparklyPaper's "Optimize canSee checks" patch.

Optimize canSee(...) checks by replacing HashMap with fastutil’s Object2ObjectOpenHashMap and adding a fast isEmpty() guard before containsKey()

Also remove redundant self-checks since ChunkMap#updatePlayer already handles them, reducing unnecessary equals() calls

diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/level/ChunkMap.java b/net/minecraft/server/level/ChunkMap.java
index eb352aa4296abc3ed4cf31c590bc0be66daf4de3..3100bd944be30b0378cf2605f793461b394c1ccc 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/server/level/ChunkMap.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/level/ChunkMap.java
@@ -1302,7 +1302,7 @@ public class ChunkMap extends ChunkStorage implements ChunkHolder.PlayerProvider
                 flag = flag && this.entity.broadcastToPlayer(player) && ChunkMap.this.isChunkTracked(player, this.entity.chunkPosition().x, this.entity.chunkPosition().z);
                 // Paper end - Configurable entity tracking range by Y
                 // CraftBukkit start - respect vanish API
-                if (flag && !player.getBukkitEntity().canSee(this.entity.getBukkitEntity())) { // Paper - only consider hits
+                if (flag && !player.getBukkitEntity().canSeeChunkMapUpdatePlayer(this.entity.getBukkitEntity())) { // Paper - only consider hits // Plazma - Optimize canSee checks
                     flag = false;
                 }
                 // CraftBukkit end
